Robin has asked me to state here my view that the BPFK proposals
for gadri are sound and successful. I think the proposals are
an admirable compromise between consistency with pre-BPFK 
Lojban and consistency with the needs for logical coherence
and expressive power. If there are still any questionmarks
in my mind (or expressed in my messages), this doesn't mean 
I think the current proposal is not fundamentally sound. But
most encouraging of all is that the BPFK has proved that it
can achieve its objectives, for all that at one time they
seemed an impossibly huge mountain to climb.

Again, sincere congratulations to Robin, xorxes & the rest
of the BPFK team.

--And.


